graph TD
    A[Payment Details] --> B[Validate Payment]
    B -->|Invalid| ERR1[Return Error]
    B -->|Valid| C[Match to Invoices]
    C -->|No Match| ERR2[Return Error]
    C -->|Matched| D[Apply Payment]
    D -->|Error| ERR3[Return Error]
    D -->|Success| E[Post to Ledger]
    E -->|Error| R1[Rollback Payment]
    E -->|Success| F[Generate Receipt]
    F -->|Error| W1[Log Warning]
    F -->|Success| DONE[Payment Complete]

    style ERR1 fill:#f96
    style ERR2 fill:#f96
    style ERR3 fill:#f96
    style R1 fill:#f96
    style W1 fill:#ff9
    style DONE fill:#9f9
